            "review_title": "Review at Churros & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Acacia P\nAustralia28 contributions\n0\nSweet treat heaven in Ha Giang\nJul 2026 • Couples\nCutest little dessert cafe in Ha Giang and excellent value! My fiance and I were craving a sweet treat and this one hit the spot. We got the churros with vanilla custard dip (freshly made - you can't go past it) plus a strawberry soda and it was so good. 10/10 would eat again.\nIt started raining while we were there but we were very cosy inside in super comfy seats. The owner is lovely and speaks excellent English. We had a great chat with her about life in Ha Giang while we ate. \nWe definitely recommend stopping by before starting the loop!\nRead more\nWritten July 27, 2026\nChurros & Café\nThank you so much for such an great review and photos. Especially with the words. Looking forward to see you again in the café 😊😊\nWritten July 30, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
